### Payment gateway - happy paths
### (AI Generayed) Card last digit drives the bank: odd -> authorized, even -> declined, 0 -> 503.
### Run top to bottom: the POSTs stash their new id so the GETs below can use it.
### The 503 request is last on purpose - it opens the circuit breaker for 5s.

### Authorize a payment (card ends 7) -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "123"
}

> {% client.global.set("authorizedId", response.body.id); %}

### Retrieve it -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/Payments/{{authorizedId}}

### Decline a payment (card ends 4) -> 201, status Declined
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248874",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 250,
  "cvv": "456"
}

> {% client.global.set("declinedId", response.body.id); %}

### Retrieve it -> 200, still Declined
GET {{host}}/api/Payments/{{declinedId}}

### USD, 4-digit CVV, 1050 = $10.50 -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",
  "expiryMonth": 12,
  "expiryYear": 2029,
  "currency": "USD",
  "amount": 1050,
  "cvv": "1234"
}

### EUR, smallest valid amount -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",
  "expiryMonth": 1,
  "expiryYear": 2031,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "amount": 1,
  "cvv": "999"
}

### Unknown id -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/Payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Bank unavailable (card ends 0) -> 502 after retries.
### LAST ON PURPOSE: this opens the circuit breaker. Anything sent in the next
### ~5 seconds gets 502 without reaching the bank. Wait, or restart the API.
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248870",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Send this immediately after the one above to see the open circuit:
### a good card, 502 anyway, and "circuit is open" in the app log. -> 502
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "123"
}
